// lib/markdown_window.ent sets a document in lines (measured here as if
// each byte were 8 wide): blocks one under another, a paragraph in more
// lines where the box is narrower, a table's cells in columns as wide as
// their widest (the second, :---:, in the middle).
// RUN: env MD_FILE=%S/Inputs/markdown/sample.md %ent run %S/Inputs/markdown/layout.ent 2>/dev/null > %t.out
// RUN: FileCheck %s --input-file=%t.out

